CORE
multiple-properties1.sv
--bound 1 --property main.p0 --property main.p2
^\[main\.p0\] always 1: PROVED up to bound 1$
^\[main\.p2\] always 1: PROVED up to bound 1$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^\[main\.p1\]
--
The --property option may be given more than once; all given properties
are checked, and the others are not.
